## Go (.go) — VS Dark+ (Smax)
syntax go "\.go$"
comment "//"

## Type / class names (PascalCase)
color #4cb "\<[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\>"
## Function / method calls:  name(
color #dda "[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*[[:space:]]*(\()"

## Declarations / keywords
color #59c "\<(package|import|func|var|const|type|struct|interface|map|chan)\>"
## Built-in types
color #59c "\<(bool|string|error|byte|rune|uintptr|int|int8|int16|int32|int64|uint|uint8|uint16|uint32|uint64|float32|float64|complex64|complex128|any|comparable)\>"

## Control flow
color #c8c "\<(if|else|switch|case|default|for|range|return|break|continue|goto|fallthrough|select|go|defer)\>"

## Built-in functions
color #dda "\<(make|new|len|cap|append|copy|delete|close|panic|recover|print|println|complex|real|imag|min|max|clear)\>"

## Constants
color #59c "\<(true|false|nil|iota)\>"
## Numbers (int, float, imaginary, hex, binary, octal, separators)
color #bca "\<([0-9][0-9_]*\.?[0-9_]*([eE][-+]?[0-9]+)?i?|0[xX][[:xdigit:]_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+)\>"

## Strings, raw strings & runes
color #c97 ""([^"\]|\\.)*"|`[^`]*`|'([^'\]|\\.)*'"

## Comments
color #6a5 "(^|[[:blank:]])//.*"
color #6a5 start="/\*" end="\*/"
